cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this tutorial, please cite the article it accompanies
  (see preferred-citation below).
type: software
title: "Anonymizing Psychological Research Data: An R Tutorial"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24287502"
abstract: >-
  Online supplementary material to the article "Anonymization of Research
  Data for Open Science in Psychology". A step-by-step R tutorial that
  demonstrates disclosure risk assessment, statistical disclosure control
  (global recoding, local suppression, rank swapping, PRAM), and utility
  assessment for a psychological research dataset using the R package
  sdcMicro.
